flowchart TD
  F[PDF / HTML / MD] --> X[Extract text; preserve PDF page]
  X --> C[120 word chunks; 24 word overlap]
  C --> E[MiniLM-L6-v2; 384 float32 dimensions]
  E --> V[(sqlite-vec + source/page/category metadata)]
  Q[POST /query] --> QE[Query embedding]
  QE --> R[Top-k exact cosine retrieval; category prefilter]
  V --> R
  R --> T{Similarity >= 0.38?}
  T -->|No| N[Deterministic abstention; zero generator tokens]
  T -->|Yes| L[Qwen grounded structured answer + source indices]
  L --> P{Valid citation bounds?}
  P -->|No| N
  P -->|Yes| A[Answer with chunk/source/page citations + latency + tokens]
